2 TITL Moctezuma Dies
1 NOTE Sixth emperor of Mexica. Died assassinated by an angry mob when a sling shot stone struck him.
2 CONT The actual details of his death are vague. Some say he was assassinated by Cortes or one of Cortes captains. Served his people 1502 through 1520.
2 CONT An interesting note: The date of Cortes arrival to Mexica was stated as 1517. He got to Tenochtlan sometime around 1518. Moctezuma was said to be expecting the fulfillment of a prophesy that spoke of the return of Quezacoatl on a 
2 CONC one reed date. For the Mayan calendar that date was a 13 ahau date. A time of change for political, religious and political ssystems. Our own date for 13 ahau in the 20th century happened on August 16, 1987. Since then things for 
2 CONC us haven't been quite the same.
2 CONT Another interesting note: The Spaniards arrived first in the Caribbean after Columbus came.
2 CONT Things changed awful fast for the ancient Taino people after their arrival.
