2 CONT '''GENERATION 4: PETRONILLA MOCTEZUMA''' (born 1552)
2 CONT
2 CONT PETRONILA SOTELO MOCTEZUMA was probably '''born around 1552 in Mexico City'''. It is '''believed that in 1571 she was married to MARTIN GABAI DE NAVARRO''', also known as MARTIN NABARRO. A marriage of Petronila and Martin has not 
2 CONC been located yet, however, they were referenced several times as an ancestral married couple "Martin Nabarro" and "Petronila Montesuma" in a 1703 Diocese of Guadalajara informacion matrimonio document for a marriage that took plac
2 CONC e in Nochistlán. The known children of Petronila Sotelo (alias Moctezuma) and of Martin Gabai de Navarro are shown below:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Maria Gabay, who married to Pedro Fernandez de Vaulus. Maria Gabay (Gabai) is also mentioned in the 1703 marriage document.
2 CONT *  Ana-Francisca Gabay, born circa 1573-1577, married circa 1594-95 to Lope Ruiz de Esparza, died March 30, 1652, Villa de Aguascalientes - married LOPE RUIZ-DE-ESPARZA. He died 14 Aug 1651 in Aguascalientes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Many of the descendants of this family as discussed in detail in "Genealogía de Nochistlán Antiguo Reino de la Nueva Galicia en el Siglo XVII Según Sus Archivos Parroquiales" by José Luis Vásquez y Rodríguez de Frías (2001).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/De_Sotelo_y_Moctezuma-3
