1 NOTE Aka: baptised Marina
2 CONT Other names: La Malinche
2 CONT also known by a very derogatory slang name that alludes to being fornicated that is used by those who consider her a traitor of her country. Others consider he a saviour because through her ability to intrepret Nahuatl to Spanish 
2 CONC she avoided misunderstanding and wars.
2 CONT It is said that she was of noble birth and that her father was a lord. When he died her mother remarried and had a boy child. Malinche was then given to traders and she became a slave. She ended up in the land of the Mayan and lea
2 CONC rned that language. Now she knew how to speak Mayan as well as Nahuatl.
2 CONT She then was given to Hernan Cortes. The rest is history.
2 CONT Interesting note:
2 CONT The year she was born on, transcribed into Aztec calendar: Born on the year 1 Reed.
2 CONT The year 1 Reed was the anticipated date of the return of Quezacoatl. Cortes invaded Tenochtilan on 1517. The Mexica thought that Cortes was Quezacoatl in human form. Its interesting to note that the Inca were expecting a return o
2 CONC f Viracocha as well.
2 CONT Copyright 2008 John J. Browne Ayes
