2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Don Juanes de Tolosa and Dona Leonor Cortez Motezuma, who was a daughter of the Marquis Hernando Cortez and Dona Isabel Motezuma, a legitimate daughter of Motezuma, late Aztec ruler of New Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore, she was the grand-daughter of Hernan Cortez and great-grand-daughter of Moctezuma, Emperor of the Aztecs.  Her father, Captain Juanes de Tolosa, was a prominent figure in the conquest and settlement of Nueva Galicia, Ne
2 CONC w Spain (Mexico).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT
