2 CONT
2 CONT Ana de Gabai, española
2 CONT
2 CONT En treinta de dicho mes y año [marzo de mil seiscientos cincuenta y dos] se enterró Ana de Gabay, mujer de Lope Ruis de Esparsa. Y por que conste lo firmé.
2 CONT
2 CONT     licenciado Pedro Rincon de Ortega 
2 CONT
2 CONT    ↑ LDS FamilySearch.org, Mexico, Aguascalientes, Catholic Church Records, 1620-1962, Aguascalientes, Asunción de María, Defunciones 1620-1752, image 61 of 560.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT
2 CONT     LDS FamilySearch.org, "Mexico Deaths, 1680-1940," index, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/N87N-5L7 : accessed 7 June 2012), Ana De Gabri. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     Mexico Deaths, 1680-1940 
2 CONT     name: Ana De Gabri 
2 CONT     gender: Female 
2 CONT     burial date: 30 Mar 1652 
2 CONT     burial place: Aguascalientes, Aguascalientes, Mexico 
2 CONT     race: White 
2 CONT     marital status: Single 
2 CONT     spouse's name: Lope Ruis 
2 CONT     indexing project (batch) number: B00093-4 
2 CONT     system origin: Mexico-EASy 
