2 CONT
2 CONT Ana Francisca de Gabay Moctezuma is supposed to have been born in 1575 in the parish of Aguascalientes, daughter of Martín de Gabay , Navarro, and Petronila de Moctezuma . She married Lope Ruiz de Esparza , originally from Pamplon
2 CONC a in the Kingdoms of Castile. They had the following 12 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorenza Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Maria Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Pedro Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Bernabe Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Bernardo Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Lorenzo Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Jacinto Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Salvador Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Ana Tomasina Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Martin Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Cristobal Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT Unknown Ruiz de Esparza
2 CONT She was buried on March 30, 1652 in the parish of Aguascalientes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death [1]
2 CONT Ana de Gabai, Spanish
2 CONT
2 CONT On the thirtieth of said month and year [March 1652] Ana de Gabay , wife of Lope Ruis de Esparsa, was buried. And for the record I signed it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Pedro Rincon de Ortega
2 CONT Fuentes
