2 CONT [692] [S2200] ORIGINS OF NM FAMILIES
2 CONT
2 CONT     * PAGE: pg. 110
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro Varela is listed as a member of the Juan de Oñate expedition of 1598, the first Spanish settlement of modern New Mexico.  He is listed as a native of Santiago in Galicia, 24 years of age, of good stature, red bearded. Son of
2 CONC  Pedro Varela, with complete armor for himself and horse.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
