1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pedro was an Alferez in 1644 and a Captain in 1667. He was condemned to death for treason in 1643 (Rosas's murder?) but escaped execution. In 1664 a meeting was held at his estancia, somewhere in the present site o
2 CONC f Albuquerque, for the founding of the official settlement in the valley of Atrisco (ONMF p. 110).
