1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Catalina de Salazar de la Cadena''' married Ruy de Mendoza, of the famous Mendoza clan, and subsequently wed Cristobal de Onate. Their son, Juan de Onate, established San Juan de Los Caballeros near present-day 
2 CONC Santa Fe, New Mexico in 1598.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 416.
2 CONT
