2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Maria Perez de OÑATE was born (date unknown). Parents: Juan Perez de OÑATE and Osana GONZALEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Ruy Diaz de ZALDIVAR. Children were: Juan de ZALDIVAR, General Vicente de ZALDIVAR.
2 CONT
