2 CONT * [2]	Agustin SALDIVAR SOSA b. 1620, m. Ana DE-SALINAS.  Agustin died 7 Feb 1677, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT * [3]	Juan SOSA SALDIVAR m. Ana MARTINEZ HERNANDEZ, (daughter of Jose MARTINEZ and Maria HERNANDEZ DIAZ).
2 CONT * [4]	Ana SOSA SALDIVAR m. Ambrocio CEPEDA DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * [5]	Mariana SOSA SALDIVAR m. Diego GARCIA DE-QUINTANILLA, (son of Lucas GARCIA RODRIGUEZ and Juliana QUINTANILLA FARIAS).
2 CONT * [6]	Margarita SOSA SALDIVAR b. 1635, m. bet 1653 and 16, Diego AYALA TREVIÑO, b. 1618 or 1619, (son of Jose TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA and Leonor DE-AYALA VALVERDE) d. 25 Dec 1682, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
