2 CONC d Francisco Macías Valades, Salvador Ruiz de Esparça, brother-in-law of the said Luis Tiscareno de Molina, godparents were Francisco Sánchez de Montes de Oca and Ana Ruiz de Esparça, his wife, brothers-in-law of the said Luis Tisc
2 CONC areño, and I signed it as a testimony of truth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorenzo de la Vera
