1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes for JUAN PEREZ-DE-ONATE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Portraitsof Basques in the New World, edited by Richard W. Etulain and Heronima Echeverria.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Links ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://longoriaf.tripod.com/onate_genealogy.htm Oñate genealogy]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Juan Perez de OÑATE2592 was born (date unknown). Upon his marriage, he moved across the Zadorra River to live in Vitoria, in the province of Alava. Thus, his name became Juan Perez de Oñate, meaning Juan Perez from Oñate, the haml
2 CONC et where he previously lived. Parents: Cristobal Perez de NARRIAHONDO and Juan Perez's MOTHER.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Osana GONZALEZ. Children were: Gov. Cristobal de OÑATE, Juan de OÑATE, Maria Perez de OÑATE.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b168.html#P1292
