1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pedro Varela Jaramillo, a Captian of sixty years escaped the 1680 Pueblo Revolt Massacre with his wife and 20 year-old son.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was dead by 1692 at the marriage of a son Juan Barela Jaramillo to Isabel Cedillo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another son, Cristobal Varela Jaramillo was described in 1681 as a native of New Mexico 16 years old with a family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cristobal and Juan returned to New Mexico with the "reconquista" 
