1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The Descendents of Don Juan Perez de Onate And Dona Osana Martinez de Gonzalez''' [Compiled by John D. Inclan]  ...  http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/onate.htm  ...  Generation No. 5 ... 7. '''MAESE DE CAMPO JU
2 CONC AN5 DE SALDIVAR-Y-ONATE''' (MARIA4 DE ONATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE, CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) was born in Vitoria, Guipuzcoa, Spain. '''He married MARINA MENDOZA-DE-MARIN in Zacatecas, Mexico, daughter of LU
2 CONC IS MARIN and MARIA DE MENDOZA. She was born in Mexico City, F.D., Mexico.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN DE SALDIVAR-Y-ONATE and MARINA MENDOZA-DE-MARIN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 13.  '''i.''' MARIA6 DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA, b. Zacatecas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ii.''' ANA DE MENDOZA, m. DOCTOR SANTIAGO DEL RIEGO, Dec 1575, Guadalajara, Jalisco, Mexico; b. Valladolid, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANA DE MENDOZA and SANTIAGO DEL RIEGO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Fundadores de Nueva Galicia - Guadalajara - Tomo I, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 68 and 70.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''iii.''' FRANCISCO DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA, d. 04 Jun 1589, Zapotlan, Jalisco, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for FRANCISCO DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 2, 1589, he signed his last will and testament. Source:Fundadores de Nueva Galicia - Guadalajara - Tomo I, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 70.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''iv.''' JUAN DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''v.''' MARIANA DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA, d. Mexico City, D. F., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''vi.''' CATALINA DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA, d. Mexico City, F.D., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. '''vii.''' LUISA DE SALDIVAR-Y-MENDOZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''viii.''' JUAN DE SALDIVAR-ONATE.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ix.''' FRAY ANTONIO DE MENDOZA.
