2 CONT '''Guido de Lavezaris''' (c.1512? - d. 1582?) was the second Spanish Governor General of the Philippines. He succeeded Miguel López de Legazpi in 1572 as governor, and was succeeded by Francisco de Sande on August 25, 1575.
