2 CONT Wedding [1]
2 CONT Nicolás de Ávila and Gertrudis de Luebana, watched
2 CONT
2 CONT In the town of Aguascalientes, on six days of the month of February, one thousand six hundred and forty-seven years, in the parish church, I married and gave birth to Nicolas de Avila and Gertrudis de Luebana, a native of this tow
2 CONC n, legitimate son of Luis de Avila and Clara de Amaia, and daughter of Juan de Luebana, deceased, and Maria Lopez. He preceded everything established by the Holy Council of Trent and admonished them the first on the twelfth of Jan
2 CONC uary, Sunday, the second on the twenty-second of the said Sunday, the third on the second of February, the day of the purification of our lady. His godfathers were Domingo Ruiz Beatris de Medina and witnesses to the marriage were 
2 CONC Martín de Esparza, Álvaro Marín, Diego Vasques de Beundia, Juan Marín. And for the record, I sign it ''ut supra''
2 CONT
2 CONT Diego de Torres y Rivera
2 CONT Fuentes
