1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes for CRISTOBAL PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Portraits of Basques in the New World, edited by Richard W. Etulain and Heronima Echeverria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cristobal Perez de NARRIAHONDO2592 was born (date unknown). A Basque, he was a resident of the hamlet of Oñate in Guipuzcoa.  According to Marc Simmons, the meaning of the Basque word Oñate is "at the foot of the mountain pass".
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Juan Perez's MOTHER.  Children were: Juan Perez de OÑATE.
2 CONT
