2 CONT Cavazos Garza, Israel.  '''''Catálogo y Síntesis de los Protocolos del Archivo Municipal de Monterrey 1700-1725''''', Universidad Autónoma de Nuevo León, Centro de Estudios Humanísticos, Monterrey, México, 1973, page 150, #1367 [X
2 CONC , fol. 152, no. 87].  ...  This protocolo is '''Agustina's will''' and first states that she is the '''widow of General Alonso de León''', states that she is '''to be buried in the parroquial's chapel of Nuestra Señora de Regla'''
2 CONC , cites religious bequests, then identifies '''her children''': Sargento Mayor '''Alonso''' de León deceased, Capitán '''Juan''' de León married to Agustina González de Quintanilla, '''Santiago''' married to Catarina García de las
2 CONC  Rivas, '''Mateo''' deceased who was married to Antonia García de Sosa, '''Inés''' married to Alonso Garrido, and '''Juana''' married to General Luis García de Pruneda.  Agustina also revokes her will of 1711.   ... '' '''Valle de
2 CONC l Pilón, 7 de septiembre de 1714'''''
