1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Catalina de Salazar was born about 1615 in Santa Fe, Kingdom of Nuevo Mexico. She was christened about 1615 in Santa Fe, Kingdom of Nuevo Mexico.  Catalina was a widow by 1663.  At this time we learn that Luis had 
2 CONC been the Alcalde Mayor and Captain of the Tewa jurisdiction. Catalina was very likely a daughter of Captain Sebastain Rodriques de Salazar.  She died after 1662 in Santa Cruz de la Canada, Kingdom of Nuevo Mexico. She was buried a
2 CONC fter 1662 in Santa Cruz de la Canada, Kingdom of Nuevo Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Catalina de Salazar was born before July 17, 1617, the first event for which there is a recorded date.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married twice. She married Luis Martín Serrano I and Pedro Hurtado Zacatecas of Mexico (on July 17, 1617). Catalina and Pedro became the parents of Andres Hurtado in Durango, Mexico circa 1628.
