2 CONT
2 CONT Origins of New Mexico Familes, by Fray Angelico Chavez, Revised Edition. Page 160.
2 CONT
2 CONT To The Royal Crown Restored, The Journals of Don Diego de Vargas, New Mexico, 1692-1694. John L. Kessell, Rick Hendricks, a Meredith Dodge, Editors.
2 CONT
2 CONT With the Makers of San Antonio, by Frederick C. Chabot.
