2 CONT
2 CONT After a little research, Garciana the wife of Alonzo Ortiz Baca has been described as Native American in a number of ways, as a woman of Analio, said to be a tribe at Pueblo de Sandia, as belonging to a tribe of Apache called Lipa
2 CONC r, which traded with the Pueblo villages on a daily basis, as member of the Tiwa tribe of New Mexico and as a Mistizo Mulata Native American. Most ancestor sites state that she was Native American and that no other information is 
2 CONC known about her parents.It is said that Alonzo had only one wife.
