1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information from Joseph H. Sanchez-9th great grandson of his wife Juana Lopez de Aragon
2 CONT
2 CONT Information from Wiki Tree Genealogy Site 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1680 he accompanied his mother-in law Ana Lopez de Aragon to Taos along with his wife Juanna Lopez de Aragon and a unnamed son. On August 10th, Sebastian was away from the house when the Indians attack began in Taos. All the fa
2 CONC mily was killed except for Sebastian.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information from "The St. Lawrence Day Massacre" by Luis Brandiner
2 CONT
2 CONT Major Sebastian Herrara Corrales and Don Francisco Duran y Chavez escaped from Taos and reported the deaths of all the Spaniards in that jurisdiction - "something more than seventy persons"
2 CONT
