2 CONT "s" is a Portuguese tradition of the spelling and that Sanchez and Munoz is the most standard in our families. It has been determined to date ( 10/2024 ) that the Frey Francisco had a relation with Juana Lopez de Aragon the sister
2 CONC  of Ana Juana Lopez Baca, Their mother was a Baca and the father was a Lopez de Aragon. The children of the relationship were Jacinto Sanchez de Inigo, Pedro de Inigo and Francisca Sanchez de Inigo. It was later discovered the Fra
2 CONC ncisco's mothers last name was Sanchez de Inigo and he gave it to the children. 
