1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Captain Juan Lozano was born in Lobón around 1530. He was the son of Alonso Hernández Lozano, Mayor of the State of Hijosdalgo de Badajoz in the first half of the 16th century, and his wife María Zapata . Captain J
2 CONC uan Lozano, according to the same information, went to New Spain in 1560," with his wife Inés Martínez, originally from Badajoz; daughter of Francisco Martínez Vaca and Isabel González, natives and neighbors of Badajoz, sons and d
2 CONC aughters. [ 1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
