1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Captain Juan Lozano was born in Lobón around 1530. He was the son of Alonso Hernández Lozano , Mayor of the State of Hijosdalgo de Badajoz in the first half of the 16th century, and his wife María Zapata. Captain 
2 CONC Juan Lozano, as stated therein information, he went to New Spain in 1560, with his wife Inés Martínez, originally from Badajoz; daughter of Francisco Martínez Vaca and Isabel González, natives and neighbors of Badajoz, sons of Dal
2 CONC go." [1]
2 CONT
