2 CONT Death [1]
2 CONT Clara, Spanish
2 CONT
2 CONT On the seventeenth day of the month of January, one thousand six hundred and sixty-seven, I buried Clara de Amaya, a woman who belonged to Luis de Ávila , in the parish church of this town [in Aguascalientes] . She did not make a 
2 CONC will or memorial because she was poor. She confessed and received all the sacraments. And I signed it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerónimo López del Carpio
2 CONT
