2 CONC   Parents: Captain Juan González de Ruvalcaba (a son of Capt. Fulgencio González de Ruvalcaba y López de Fuenllana and Luisa de Rodas), and Catalina Díaz Barroso.  Her parents, not known to me.  The family moved to their hacie
2 CONC nda near Silao between the above christening date and 26 November 1665, date of the Silao christening of daughter Francisca (married to Juan Bartolomé Fernández de Souza y Acevedo).
2 CONT
