1 CONT Son of Alonso Gonzáles, native of Cartaya, swarthy, tall, black bearded, a big gash over his left eye, 30 years of age
1 CONT __________________________________
1 CONT Apellido: Pedraza
1 CONT Origen: Castellano. De Medina de Pomar en el partido judicial de Villarcayo (Burgos).Una rama pasó a Sevilla.
1 CONT Descripcion de su Escudo de Armas: Escudo partido: 1o de plata con un árbol de sinople terrasadode lo mismo y un lobo de sable pasante al pie del tronco. 2o de gules con una cruz recortada de veros. Bordura de gules con ocho aspas
1 CONC  de oro.
1 CONT ____________________
1 CONT Juan de Pedraza, thirty years old, the son of Alonso González and a native of Cartaya, Spain, came with the Oñate forces of 1598. He was dark and tall, with a black beard and a wound above the left eye. It is not known who his wif
1 CONC e was; two Pedraza women, Beatriz and Isabel, were in all likelihood his daughters.
