1 CONC  her husband, and her relatives. Doña Ana and her husband provided 44,000 pesos for the founding of the convent. Her uncle, Don Fernándo de Oñate, gave 4,000 pesos, while her first cousin, Francisco de Zaldívar, contributed 3,000 
1 CONC pesos, with an additional 4,000 pesos given by another uncle, Cristóbal de Oñate.
